---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mini Clinics"
  description="AZPVA Mini Clinics — coached by Garrett Starkey. Small groups of 3–5 athletes. Packages: $99 / $399 / $749. Dates published 14 days ahead."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Training options</p>
      <h1>Mini Clinics</h1>
      <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85)">
        Small-group sessions with a minimum of 3 and a maximum of 5 vaulters — open to all skill levels. Every session is coached by Garrett Starkey.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>
        Mini Clinics are focused technique sessions in a small group of <strong>at least 3 and no more than 5 athletes</strong>.
        These sessions will be coached by <strong>Garrett Starkey</strong>.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li>Open to all skill levels</li>
        <li>Minimum 3 / maximum 5 vaulters per session</li>
        <li>Coached by Garrett Starkey</li>
        <li>Dates published at least <strong>14 days in advance</strong></li>
        <li>Every session is coached (~90 minutes)</li>
        <li>Access to AZPVA pole inventory</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Pricing</h2>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li><strong>1 session — $99</strong> per vaulter</li>
        <li><strong>5 sessions — $399</strong> (save $96)</li>
        <li><strong>10 sessions — $749</strong> (save $250)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>All sessions must be paid in advance at booking.</p>

      <h2>Upcoming dates</h2>
      <p>First published Mini Clinic times:</p>
      <ul class="list-check">
        <li><strong>Friday, October 2</strong> — 5:00–6:30 PM</li>
        <li><strong>Friday, October 16</strong> — 5:00–6:30 PM</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="muted">
        Additional dates will be posted about two weeks ahead. Call to reserve — sessions need at least three athletes to run.
      </p>
      <p>Call or text <a href="tel:+14807666017"><strong>(480) 766-6017</strong></a> to book.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
